# Real downloaded PCIe/CXL sources and the chunked passage corpus built from them.
# Regenerate with: python scripts/fetch_corpus.py && python -m assistant.ingest
# (data/raw/ holds the real files fetch_corpus.py downloads from corpus_manifest.json's
# public URLs; data/corpus.jsonl is the chunked passages ingest.py builds from them. The
# CXL 1.1 Specification and its 2.0 errata are copyrighted by the CXL Consortium, not
# public domain, so this project never commits their extracted text.)
data/raw/
data/corpus.jsonl
